---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Drop-in Sessions" description="Weekly open online drop-in sessions for HASS and Indigenous research practitioners">
  <h1>Drop-in Sessions</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    The RSE-CEP runs a weekly open online drop-in session for researchers, RSEs, and practitioners
    working in HASS and Indigenous research. No registration. No formal agenda. Just conversation.
  </p>

  <dl class="session-meta">
    <div>
      <dt>When</dt>
      <dd>Every Wednesday, 2:00 PM AEST</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Where</dt>
      <dd><a href="https://anu.zoom.us/j/84484139266?pwd=bH6XRicOe2bYukSJH6OmeLJCYFxwLQ.1">Join on Zoom →</a></dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Who</dt>
      <dd>Any researcher, RSE, or practitioner in the HASS &amp; Indigenous research space. Everyone welcome.</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <h2>Monthly topic rotation</h2>
  <table class="rotation-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Week</th>
        <th>Topic</th>
        <th>2026 dates</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>1st Wednesday</td>
        <td>Authentication, Licensing &amp; Access</td>
        <td>3 Jun · 8 Jul · 5 Aug · 2 Sep · 7 Oct · 4 Nov · 2 Dec</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>2nd Wednesday</td>
        <td>AI Coding best practice</td>
        <td>10 Jun · 15 Jul · 12 Aug · 9 Sep · 14 Oct · 11 Nov · 9 Dec</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3rd Wednesday</td>
        <td>Collections, Metadata &amp; Schemas</td>
        <td>20 May · 17 Jun · 22 Jul · 19 Aug · 16 Sep · 21 Oct · 18 Nov · 16 Dec</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>4th Wednesday</td>
        <td>HASS RSE work and career paths</td>
        <td>27 May · 24 Jun · 29 Jul · 26 Aug · 23 Sep · 28 Oct · 25 Nov</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Format</h2>
  <p>
    Each week, attendees are invited to join conversations about the listed topic — or just listen.
    We discuss projects, workflows, technical challenges, tools, and design decisions. There is no
    judgement or evaluation of the work presented. Sessions may also include breakout rooms for
    more focused discussion.
  </p>
  <ul class="format-list">
    <li><strong>Open</strong> — no invitation required</li>
    <li><strong>Online</strong> — accessible across Australia and internationally</li>
    <li><strong>Informal</strong> — to encourage candid discussion</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why these sessions?</h2>
  <p>
    These sessions create a regular space where practitioners can connect, share perspectives, and
    build a shared understanding of technical directions. By coming together informally, we aim to
    surface real challenges, exchange practical knowledge, and strengthen community across the network.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 580px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .session-meta {
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .session-meta div {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  dt {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .rotation-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .rotation-table th {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .rotation-table td {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .rotation-table tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .rotation-table td:last-child {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .format-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .format-list li {
    padding: 0.6rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .format-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .session-meta div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .rotation-table {
      display: block;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .rotation-table th:first-child,
    .rotation-table td:first-child {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
